Cobalt Strike’s Malleable C2 profiles (e.g., `http2_pivot.profile`) obfuscate C2 traffic. Example profile:
```profile
http2 {
    set sleeptime "2000,3000";
    set jitter "0,0";
    client {
        header "Accept" "application/grpc";
        header "Content-Type" "application/grpc";
        header "Te" "trailers";
        metadata "beacon_type" "HTTP/2";
    }
}
```
Traffic evasion steps:
